                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "It looks like this is currently only used by `openpower-vpd-parser`.  Are they ok with this deprecation note?  Can we rename all the uses there and  remove it to?  What is the actual deprecation plan?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/Ethernet.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Liu",
                        "email": "liuer@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "liuer-sys"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for the reminder, I will discuss the situation with them and then reply."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/Ethernet.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Liu",
                        "email": "liuer@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "liuer-sys"
                    },
                    "message": "Status: I've been pinging the corresponding owner on Discord for about two weeks now and haven't received a response."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/NetworkAdapter.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 4,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Does this include an embedded PHY?  I'm trying to understand how the BMC's direct-attach PHYs would be represented by your proposal.  That seems to be the primary use in openpower-vpd-parser."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/NetworkAdapter.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 4,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Liu",
                        "email": "liuer@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "liuer-sys"
                    },
                    "message": "Thank you for review. The current description of Item.Ethernet is \"Implement to provide Ethernet card attributes.\", which does not explicitly describe\nembedded PHY semantics. So I'm not sure if I need to add any more descriptions.\n\nBut in PS7, I have extended NetworkAdapter's description to include an example explicitly covering \"embedded network controllers such as BMC direct-attach PHYs\". If the openpower-vpd-parser maintainers feel further detail would be helpful, I would be glad to extend it further -- please let me know."
                }
            ],
